  "prompt": "How many order lines shipped to each country, and how many of them were for 2 or more units? Use the sales table, where country_code is the country an order ships to. Return three columns, in this order: country_code, n_lines, the number of order lines, and multi_unit_lines, the number of order lines with units of 2 or more. Every order line counts in n_lines, including lines with missing units; a line with missing units is not a multi-unit line. Return one row per country_code. Any row order is fine.",
